[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Chromium (omaego shim → Chrome)
Comment=omarchy-launch-webapp falls back to this entry for any default browser
Comment[1]=it does not recognise; it points at omaego-webapp so web apps get an ego.
Exec=__BIN__/omaego-webapp %U
Icon=google-chrome
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
Categories=Network;WebBrowser;
